      "description": "Metric: lattice_e2e_latency_seconds (histogram, seconds). SLO: online P2P P99<50ms, alert line P99>100ms. ⚠ the current implementation only calls observe(0.0) in the keepalive seq-watermark branch (placeholder), so it stays 0 until real E2E instrumentation lands.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "axisCenteredZero": false,
            "axisColorMode": "text",
